#, kde-format
msgid "Include prefix/suffix"
msgstr "Include prefiks/sufiks"

#: libs/caliaseditor.cpp:190
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Prefix/suffix of matched text will be automatically appended to the expanded "
"text."
msgstr "Prefiks/sufiks od matched tekst će biti automatski appended za  expanded tekst."

#: libs/caliaseditor.cpp:194
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>With global matching, one alias/trigger can match multiple times, if it "
"contains the pattern more than once. For example, if pattern is abc, it "
"matches only once on abcdabcd of global matching is off, but twice if it is "
"on. For each match, the requested actions are performed - so the commands "
"can be sent multiple times, once per match.</p><p>Note that failing the "
"condition doesn't terminate scanning, so you can use this to highlight names "
"from a list (using the condition to check if a match is in the list), or "
"something like that."
msgstr "<p>S globalni podudarni, jedan alias/okidač može podudaranje više times, ako ga sadrži  pattern više nego once. Za primjer, ako pattern je abc, ga matches samo once na abcdabcd od globalni podudarni je off, but twice ako ga je na. Za svaki podudaranje,  requested actions su performed - so  naredbe može biti sent više times, once per podudaranje.</p><p>Note taj failing  uvjet doesn't terminate scanning, so vi može upotrijebite ovaj za highlight names iz  popis (upotrebljavajući  uvjet za označite ako  podudaranje je u  popis), ili something poput taj."

